{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666700/extras/artbook1.png?t=1745330399\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Digital artbook consisting of 60 pages, in PDF format, with art from the game \u201cVasilisa and Baba Yaga\u201d. Contains images of fairy tale characters, various evil spirits, details of locations and battle arenas with comments from the developers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666700/extras/artbook3.png?t=1745330399\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Paper theater on five sheets, in PDF format, which can be printed and assembled to act out scenes from the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The theatre can be printed on A4 or A3 sheets, preferably on thick paper or thin cardboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666700/extras/\u0434\u0435\u043a\u043e\u0440.png?t=1745330399\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3666700?t=1745330399","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666700/a3726de81b598f07a54f931a00c6774a8c907791/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745330399","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666700/2cffdf82a1ee38732f9b7c1acb0ba9f14b09b8d3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745330399","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666700/2cffdf82a1ee38732f9b7c1acb0ba9f14b09b8d3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745330399","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"n